Modified files (November 2026):
- jitouch/Jitouch/Gesture.m: Magic Mouse fingertip drawing recognizer, multi-stroke letters, personal handwriting
  matching, scroll and click guards, gesture log.
- jitouch/Jitouch/GestureView.h, GestureView.m, GestureWindow.h, GestureWindow.m: pen-up between strokes, finger
  position ring, ink drawn in the mouse surface's proportions.
- jitouch/Jitouch/JitouchAppDelegate.m: quits if another copy is already running.
- README.md: rewritten for this fork. .gitignore: excludes personal recordings and build output.

New files (November 2026): jitouch/Jitouch/PDollar.h, PDollar.m ($P point-cloud recognizer, after Vatavu, Anthony
and Wobbrock, ICMI 2012), build.sh, make-signing-identity.sh, support/, tests/, tools/.
